---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { endpoint } from '../../data.js';
---
<Base title="Supply recycled materials with Bukjum" description="Connect recycled plastic material supply with wholesale buyers in Nigeria."><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">FOR MATERIAL SUPPLIERS</p><h1>Bring your supply.<br /><em>Build a connection.</em></h1><p>Bukjum is building a marketplace that connects recycled material suppliers with industrial buyers.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container supplier-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</p><h2>Reliable details<br /><em>help business move.</em></h2><p class="body-copy">Tell us what material you have, how it is processed, the quantities you can supply and where it is located. Accurate details help us match supply with buyer requirements.</p><div class="supplier-facts"><div><strong>01</strong><span>Share your materials and processing steps</span></div><div><strong>02</strong><span>Tell us your volume, packaging and location</span></div><div><strong>03</strong><span>We follow up to understand buyer fit</span></div></div></div><div class="form-card"><h2>Register your interest</h2><p>Share basic supply details. We'll follow up to learn more.</p>{endpoint ? <form action={endpoint} method="POST"><input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Bukjum supplier registration" /><label>Name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required /></label><label>Business email<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required /></label><label>Company / cooperative<input name="company" autocomplete="organization" /></label><label>Material(s)<input name="materials" placeholder="PET, HDPE, PP…" required /></label><label>Approximate monthly volume (tonnes)<input name="volume" type="number" min="0" step="0.5" /></label><label>Location and processing<textarea name="details" rows="4" placeholder="State, processing steps, packaging and other useful details"></textarea></label><button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Send supplier enquiry <span>↗</span></button></form> : <div class="form-pending"><strong>Online enquiry form needs setup</strong><p>Formspree endpoint ownership and delivery testing are pending. Bukjum contact details also need confirmation before this page can accept enquiries.</p><small>Configure and test the verified Formspree endpoint, or add a confirmed contact address before launch.</small></div>}</div></div></section></Base>
